## CorA (Corpus Annotator)

CorA is a web-based annotation tool for word-level annotation of historical and
other non-standard language data.  It was originally developed to annotate
historical texts for the [Anselm corpus][Anselm] and the
[reference corpus of Early New High German][ReF], but has since been used for a
variety of other projects, including the
[annotation of social media data][EmpiriST].

